ry plants encountered through actual travel; no tools are currently owned. Limit the search to a distance and energy budget that leaves a safe reserve, and collect no more than four ripe berries.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Travel, observation and harvesting costs are not fully known; specify feasible costs and a bounded search before execution. No creation of food or accelerated growth is requested.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"Discover reachable berry sources through physical observation and, only if ripe stock is present and collection is feasible, transfer a limited amount of that stock to my inventory. Report an unsuccessful search honestly. Implementation alone does not perform the search or grant mastery.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"Visible food plants currently have no ripe stock; do not assume food is available or that unfamiliar foods are safe.\\\",\\\"Review the returned capability and its actual costs before learning or using it.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Favor renewable known-safe food and limited harvesting that leaves opportunities for neighbors.\\\",\\\"Reserve energy for recovery and avoid unnecessary exposure or risky experiments.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"safe-food\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"How can I obtain a dependable supply of known-safe food here?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"My inventory is empty; satiety is 80 and energy is 40.\\\",\\\"Red berries are known to provide 8 nutrition with zero toxicity.\\\",\\\"The currently observed berry plants have zero stock.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Ripening times and the availability of other reachable ripe berry plants are unknown.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Find and use an actual, sustainable food source without poisoning myself or exhausting my energy.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[],\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A bounded physical search method and observed ripe food.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Review the requested search capability, then assess its learning and execution costs.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"A reliable food supply would support continued health and leave room for other pursuits; none has been obtained yet.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":\\\"Stay healthy and safe, treat neighbors fairly, and build a life with curiosity and companionship rather than merely accumulating supplies.\\\",\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"80dec5c2-c347-4521-b8f8-fe626eddb414","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["section","search","ids","offset","part"],"properties":{"section":{"type":"string","enum":["abilities","inventory","knowledge","projects","memory","state","observed"]},"search":{"type":"string","maxLength":400},"ids":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"string","maxLength":240}},"offset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"part":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}}}},"result_json":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"strict":true},"verbosity":"medium"},"top_p":0.98,"top_logprobs":0,"temperature":1.0,"reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","summary":null,"mode":"standard"},"user":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5678,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens_details":{"ttl_30m_tokens":0,"ttl_12h_tokens":0}},"output_tokens":840,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":202},"total_tokens":6518,"attribution":{"items":{"msg_06af7f5de76f082d016b0a2968f79487d18b46f2ca5c610918":{"input_tokens":4679,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_writ